{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t法國多個主要城市，星期六再次出現大規模遊行或集會，內政部表示，全國大約有32萬人參與集會。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n法新社報道，在馬賽和圖盧茲等多個城市，集會氣氛較為緊張。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n至於首都巴黎，警方說大約有7萬人上街集會，比對上一個周末少，已經加強警力戒備，防範集會再次升級成暴力衝突。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:08.286741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T19:10:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:19.221343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:10.439374+00:00","content_hash":"81f4404ce187c64a2163a62406a8fa0cafa4f598f3d670c462e45870c8ce72eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}